Homepage: https://github.com/Katon17/pvz-native-linux
Description: Native Linux port of Plants vs. Zombies (Game of the Year)
 Launcher and asset manager for a native, plugin-free Linux build of
 Plants vs. Zombies: Game of the Year Edition, powered by the open source
 PvZ-Portable engine (SDL3 + OpenGL ES 2.0).
 .
 This package ships the engine and the launcher only. It does not contain
 game assets. You must supply main.pak and the properties/ folder from a
 copy of the game you own (Steam, EA App, or the original PopCap CD/ISO).
 The first-run wizard extracts those files from your ISO, ZIP, game folder,
 or directly from the official Plants vs. Zombies installer (.exe).
 .
 Requires OpenGL ES 2.0 or OpenGL 2.1 capable graphics drivers.
